msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫His eyebrows were furrowed, creating deep creases on his "
"forehead."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫那时……⟪k:8⟫他脸上的神色异常可怖。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D45B5FCA_5D60_4431_BFFF_60E9F8A95EDF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4767be779bb88c6d450cdd5cc073f480478fa3e2ffd566324766c7947e02214c
#. default-sha256: 1095b4d5907810a594801282a1c2d6c774954009ad84a600b674ae7d152847f7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D45B5FCA_5D60_4431_BFFF_60E9F8A95EDF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Several servants stood off to the side, watching their master attentively as he stomped past "
"them down the corridor."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫看到主人踩着重重的脚步经过走廊，⟪k:1⟫几位佣人不明所以地瞪大了眼睛……"

#: scenario3:scenario3_DB23B185_3C98_4A22_961D_7F78A5D37274
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0594d78b75636e815b8689b7569c2fe439d6aeb6d9661a977c1c0b96bc5a1ba6
#. default-sha256: 4b2f315b44d3e2aecfdefc53209fa7b6aff10223a0cb8de452ded9bf0c389fc3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DB23B185_3C98_4A22_961D_7F78A5D37274"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫However, no one said a word to him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫但谁都不敢向他搭话。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_621886FE_B154_42C2_95E1_319ABE98F6A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3891ea4c0ccf025d9833de31200cc286ab2479e8c0fbe3819e0f9cdec4f73d6d
#. default-sha256: 994f4e2c43bbdaeb67f3bfa73601193108b8ddaecfec0c0d0dc3f32e318590c1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_621886FE_B154_42C2_95E1_319ABE98F6A9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Had I not been preoccupied attending to his countryman..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫而下仆那时候，⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫正在被迫应付他的那位故乡来客……"

#: scenario3:scenario3_7E2E929C_3397_45DA_9D13_F550D9D64B36
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 16f383db3e36bd41d31ce273513c0b7d8cb978c3c92c7e316249ce7b50a20ac6
#. default-sha256: 5c38540a2cf9282fd3e1466b796180fb132ed87e4e2693e91a7d044beecb5da2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7E2E929C_3397_45DA_9D13_F550D9D64B36"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I likely could have prevented it. ⟪k:1⟫The look on his face would have made it obvious "
"something bad was about to happen."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫下仆明明能阻止这一切的。⟪k:1⟫因为，⟪k:2⟫光看他的表情只会产生不祥的预感不是吗。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_DB124CDA_06A0_40A4_B48D_4C788CC3C5C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e9af69e86c6414357aebc8403bd35ef0bb180dd685d354ac7d9a83bccaae7b3
#. default-sha256: 7c9f8d81e7d9ab1bbee977d942c35bdde16afc2ecf7a4357665101ef3ac733dc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DB124CDA_06A0_40A4_B48D_4C788CC3C5C0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Something that would serve only to further her misfortune."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫她的不幸，⟪k:1⟫还会继续恶化……这种，⟪k:2⟫不祥的预感。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_AD6C8D50_71DF_468B_BB0E_28D21C6CED84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 57474cdc29c6a34099baed4f4526d8c8a075b026a6bd586305507f1bbb92f24a
#. default-sha256: 4ffb8c7718394ce6b3dad681c2a5818551284c5fe2277b96154645751f231b7c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AD6C8D50_71DF_468B_BB0E_28D21C6CED84"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was already in a less-than-ideal situation..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫她所处的境况，⟪k:1⟫绝算不上好——"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9DD0CD29_9AA8_4F02_95D7_5BFA9472D9BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 372324aa747f5c3aa4745ed29096305279c97b53a9cd4629c212d959da9aecde
#. default-sha256: b78642c26cb4356004d2fcc3520dcfa577d2ffa950a1e01c9b5cd0a9ae98de9a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9DD0CD29_9AA8_4F02_95D7_5BFA9472D9BD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and it was perched on the edge of a hill, soon to begin rolling down into even worse "
"territory."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫而这种境况，⟪k:1⟫宛如从下坡道滚落般，⟪k:2⟫还在朝着——⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫更恶劣的方向滚去。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_35EB0DD6_8F2D_43CF_B988_9B60E252CBA3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 26d09eaff6aab38ce25e5fd72700c57b92ce9a9ec5a390861560f0949528caa4
#. default-sha256: 1b80dd7da9632b1b06ef56111ee994f75ffb1669581e4ce6d718c2fd99abdb51
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_35EB0DD6_8F2D_43CF_B988_9B60E252CBA3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫…………"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B9D9C0F1_53A4_45D8_ADF1_A00DF53E7815
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c245b110e29fddc356e279890f4e222ad794ca71f496e3b50bf1fbe0ba0bd4b0
#. default-sha256: 7e38e23df6ea31b614f95137a7066a093423f33e2802b422e6bd4599c5576f9d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B9D9C0F1_53A4_45D8_ADF1_A00DF53E7815"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫J-⟪k:1⟫Jacopo?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫亲、⟪k:1⟫亲爱的……？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_458D4615_C573_4AFB_8C6F_895C44935729
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 231b677ad5a201f88eb227e3b29b1f72f0cab45cf1891deb3d6fae8ee16bcd3f
#. default-sha256: 8e8635299637dbea2b4b0c8380ec76428e8380e328d17597e17343a547d162a7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_458D4615_C573_4AFB_8C6F_895C44935729"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What’s the matter?⟪k:1⟫If you wanted to visit,⟪k:2⟫you could have said something,⟪k:3⟫rather "
"than coming in without knocking..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫怎么了吗，⟪k:1⟫突然——连门都没敲……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫要来的话，⟪k:4⟫只要说一声……"

#: scenario3:scenario3_2CB44302_C7F4_4FBF_8044_6F8447035E76
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a28b719885ae5dc86dc6a1d2d62ce14ebbc20d41f71ddb900de4ba6735de478a
#. default-sha256: f6c96b76da1dc84a9d7ec9a17fad72b58e679cb7aea0418033e5340d1e105d3a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2CB44302_C7F4_4FBF_8044_6F8447035E76"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Is that... ⟪k:1⟫really necessary?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫不……的话，⟪k:1⟫就不行吗……"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5D7311C3_EBB9_4D79_9679_B329368EC393
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: edcd89780990b95315f1907709ab2abef2665c90b64a601f7be6b3285b091347
