msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5D7311C3_EBB9_4D79_9679_B329368EC393"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Pardon...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫哎………？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_50F2B486_E343_43DE_BD33_53EBE3D9369B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5f787c896baf8e82aad62e472ea397aa39f3709e1abb1cec44e64060116a7d1c
#. default-sha256: 0d3ab4a00665eb411abb33ca21d95c9452f5b34555e4ac2a72a12da9dac3f757
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_50F2B486_E343_43DE_BD33_53EBE3D9369B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Is there something you so "
"desperately want to keep from me that I must ⟪k:12⟫knock⟪k:13⟫ before entering?! That I should "
"have to let you know in advance that I’m coming?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫不敲门就不行，⟪k:12⟫你有那么想要藏起"
"来的东西吗！⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫是不是必须把我来你这里的事情，⟪k:15⟫及时通知给某个人！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C21552BE_DC90_4421_84B0_475F9A495E98
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 68a23bbbe9ee968e6fe192abe0f15c9b64814c5f24e62871cd7120e1f9be890f
#. default-sha256: 6d5a9ce77321f0c9d57f7cd38a895c228735d61d54c4b571a713daafc31f923e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C21552BE_DC90_4421_84B0_475F9A495E98"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Wh-⟪k:1⟫What— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫What are you—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫——亲爱的，⟪k:1⟫你在说什么……"

#: scenario3:scenario3_BB18F7D5_9D06_4F75_9ADC_BDE7A2B489CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7dde85b6abde39aebf2484c0263f8ea61162d3e8307ad516c59d57cb4a833476
#. default-sha256: 0a5f782c3194e4bb8a9a47fdc921f466569070fc952d2df053b48e5ddfcf331e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_BB18F7D5_9D06_4F75_9ADC_BDE7A2B489CD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Well?! ⟪k:1⟫Is there?!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You went to talk to ⟪k:5⟫him⟪k:6⟫ behind my back, I’m "
"told!⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫What’d you tell him?! You moan to him about my behavior?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫啊啊！？⟪k:1⟫怎么回事！⟪k:2⟫背着我找那家伙商量！ ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫都说了什么？⟪k:5⟫抱怨我的举止吗！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F67CBE6B_5A5D_4BDC_85B5_C83332780DB4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b10324a0325024a1bc3aafa1216755e6de9a7535978ed188d70b24ac4e48879e
#. default-sha256: 452e33af98f72d76b3151d0ed90143804dec58858daf1ddbf8e104e866c99be0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F67CBE6B_5A5D_4BDC_85B5_C83332780DB4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫—?! ⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Ah—! ⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫Ngh, ⟪k:17⟫that hurts!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫——！？⟪k:13⟫啊……！⟪k:14⟫呜"
"⟪k:15⟫……好痛……！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_56133238_9AFE_46C2_AE40_146A4E02CA49
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 90eb3e2668e61443f43258074dcb5a9d9dfc0eed8f13bfeb53aebe361847ac80
#. default-sha256: ed5fd0111c88485a2c8adbbaa76d16dd7cf2550023b27301c4f3cd13f7c62f79
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_56133238_9AFE_46C2_AE40_146A4E02CA49"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You told him I’m rough with you?!⟪k:1⟫You cried on his shoulder because I’m not ⟪k:2⟫nice "
"enough⟪k:3⟫?!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Him!⟪k:7⟫ Of all people!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫说我太严厉！？⟪k:1⟫哭诉我一点也不温柔吗！  ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫偏偏还是对那种男人！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A545B7E9_6952_4FD5_8931_2C61301376E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f9ab2b502b97a34a13dc0cc5dfcb7481cc1ff3c43ef5bc20da0259e7e9d57f3
#. default-sha256: db95f9ce54859c57fdcdeec0ca7d96821062fa808f281f70a537f35233f8b9c8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A545B7E9_6952_4FD5_8931_2C61301376E2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫W-⟪k:13⟫Wait, Jacopo!⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫You’re mistaken! Let me—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫等、⟪k:13⟫等一下，⟪k:14⟫亲爱的"
"——！  ⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫你误会了，⟪k:17⟫请听我说……！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_74215A9D_29DA_4DAD_9359_CD732F2F5186
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 756c5c6b5f2cea510662357df52e9054f803144cae5cfc4a0de1b2b238080e07
#. default-sha256: 3f9267c11e38ddd79b0e68d3b7e398653927d3f3bebf46bd49b9114ae499ad3a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_74215A9D_29DA_4DAD_9359_CD732F2F5186"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Silence! Not a word! Not a single godforsaken word!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The only thing that comes out "
"of your mouth is excuses!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Lies and fabrication!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫吵死了，⟪k:1⟫闭嘴，⟪k:2⟫闭嘴闭嘴闭嘴！！  ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫你说的全是借口，⟪k:5⟫全是谎话！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_1101EC98_EE9E_4344_AE98_E834C4B1E946
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d9cc113ac042d0bdd04161fa8a9674c90fc7881923c7132752a97e9240d66a0e
#. default-sha256: d9188a6966cc20b366ab75722c15f773a314ebac6833557b1b24d8e09f8b7fa6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1101EC98_EE9E_4344_AE98_E834C4B1E946"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You put on this sweet, innocent little girl act,⟪k:1⟫but what’s ⟪k:2⟫really⟪k:3⟫ going "
"through your head?!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Maybe I should just rip that mask off your face!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫总是装出一副贤良贞淑的样子——私下里不知在想些什么！⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫干脆就把你那层假面撕下来……！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_56598359_5762_4D24_92A8_0AE6BDD415E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e6a907da6a688bd175ccbb28fc07edc7a6692df39b328251f2a139954a9b678d
#. default-sha256: bb7ba03efab67007119f129c6806cd5ab3bd73af311271c1eb6aaaa653ab18b0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_56598359_5762_4D24_92A8_0AE6BDD415E4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫S-⟪k:1⟫Stop— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Jacopo!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫不、⟪k:1⟫不要⟪k:2⟫……亲爱的……！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5430C9E4_D756_4A69_A643_FE060E198187
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 29921d7771f4cfac652f36c3ac46b2ddee53d51b87c363e0aeacddbe19d6d06a
#. default-sha256: a28ed1651e49877599c6253318ddba5b33bfe80d8d7b896065b2603dcf457894
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5430C9E4_D756_4A69_A643_FE060E198187"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫You look down on me!⟪k:7⟫You’re nobility!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫很看不起我吧！⟪k:7⟫反正，⟪k:8⟫你是贵族出身——"

